      "text": "Step 5: The slope of line \\(PA\\) is \\(\\frac{0 - 1}{vt - 0} = -\\frac{1}{vt}\\), and the slope of line \\(PB\\) is \\(\\frac{0 - 1}{3vt - 0} = -\\frac{1}{3vt}\\).",
