      "text": "Step 6: The tangent of \\(\\angle APB\\) is given by the formula for the tangent of the difference of two angles:\n\\[\n\\tan(\\angle APB) = \\left| \\frac{-\\frac{1}{vt} + \\frac{1}{3vt}}{1 + \\left(-\\frac{1}{vt}\\right)\\left(-\\frac{1}{3vt}\\right)} \\right| = \\left| \\frac{-\\frac{1}{vt} + \\frac{1}{3vt}}{1 + \\frac{1}{3v^2t^2}} \\right| = \\left| \\frac{-\\frac{2}{3vt}}{1 + \\frac{1}{3v^2t^2}} \\right| = \\left| \\frac{-\\frac{2}{3vt}}{\\frac{3v^2t^2 + 1}{3v^2t^2}} \\right| = \\left| \\frac{-2 \\cdot 3v^2t^2}{3vt(3v^2t^2 + 1)} \\right| = \\left| \\frac{-2vt}{3v^2t^2 + 1} \\right| = \\frac{2vt}{3v^2t^2 + 1}\n\\]",
