      "text": "Step 7: To find the maximum value of \\(\\tan(\\angle APB)\\), we need to maximize the function \\(f(t) = \\frac{2vt}{3v^2t^2 + 1}\\). This is equivalent to maximizing \\(g(t) = \\frac{2t}{3t^2 + 1}\\) because \\(v\\) is a constant.",
